sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant F as 前端工作台
    participant G as 确认闸口
    participant D as 任务派发
    participant W as Worker
    participant V as AI厂商

    U->>F: 输入题材+主角人设
    F->>G: POST /novels/generate
    G->>G: 复述需求 + 预估成本
    G-->>F: 确认卡(intent+params+cost)
    U->>F: 确认/修改/放弃
    F->>G: POST /ai_requests/{id}/confirm
    G->>D: 派发任务
    D->>W: TaskRecord(queued)
    W->>V: 调用 DeepSeek 生成小说
    V-->>W: 章节+角色+大纲
    W->>W: 记账 cost_log
    W-->>F: 任务完成(success)
    F-->>U: 小说章节展示